#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kverbos; helps learning Spanish verb conjugation. In contrast to the old 1."
"x version it isn't necessary for the user to capture verb data before "
"learning. &kverbos; comes with a set of more than 9 000 verbs and the "
"corresponding conjugation patterns. This does not mean that the program can "
"answer every question about Spanish verbs now. It is not the result of "
"linguistic research. Its purpose is to support persons learning Spanish."
msgstr ""
"&kverbos; pomaže učenju konjugacije španskih glagola. U poređenju sa starom "
"1.x verzijom nije neophodno za korisnika da napravi bazu glagola prije "
"učenja.   &kverbos;  sadrži skup više od 9 000 glagola i odgovarajućih "
"šablona konjugacija. Ovo ne znači da program može odgovoriti na svako "
"pitanje u vezi sa španskim glagolima. On nije rezultat lingvističkog "
"istaživanja. Njegova svrha je da podrži osobe koje uče Španski jezik."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The main purpose is to learn the verb forms. &kverbos; selects one of the "
"verbs and a time, the user enters the different forms of the verb and the "
"program tells if the solutions are correct. Graphic is used to give a "
"feedback to the user. The user can select the verbs and times that he wants "
"to practice."
msgstr ""
"Glavni cilj je da se nauče oblici glagola.  &kverbos;  odabire jedan od "
"glagola i vrijeme, korisnik unosi različite forme glagola i program odgovara "
"da li je rješenje tačno. Grafika je korištena da da povratnu informaciju "
"korisniku. Korisnik može odabrati glagole i vremena kada želi da vježba."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kverbos; can be used to look up unknown verb forms, too."
msgstr ""
"&kverbos; može biti korišten za traćenje nepoznatih oblika glagola također."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since KDE4 verbs can be trained in sentences, too. Also other grammar "
"exercises with gaps are possible. The program comes without such exercises "
"but it is possible to download such exercises. Look for information about "
"installing exercises in chapter 5 and about creating exercises in chapter 4."
msgstr ""
"Od KDE4 glagoli mogu biti korišteni i u rečenicama također. Isto tako i "
"ostale gramatičke vježbe sa prazninama su moguće. Program dolazi bez takvih "
"vježbi ali je moguće skinuti ih sa Interneta. Pogledajte informacije o "
"instalacijama vježbi u poglavlju 5 i o pravljenju vježbi u poglavlju 4."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working with &kverbos;"
msgstr "Rad sa &kverbos;-som"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you start &kverbos; you will see the menu window first. In the tree "
"view you can select the exercise you want to do. A double click on a menu "
"entry is one possibility to select and start an exercise. At the bottom of "
"the window you have five round buttons to control the application."
msgstr ""
"Kada pokrenete &kverbos; vidjet ćete prozor izbornika prvo. U tri vrste "
"prikaza možete odabrati vježbi koju želite da radite. Dupli klik na stavke "
"izbornika je jedna mogućnost odabira i pokretanja vježbe. Na dnu prozora  "
"ima pet okruglih dugmadi koji kontrolišu aplikaciju."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Menu-Windows of &kverbos;"
msgstr "Izbornik-Prozori &kverbos;-a"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot"
msgstr "Snimka zaslona"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your first step using the program should be to select verbs and tenses. Use "
"the <guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"button_config_kl.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Config button</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> "
"config-button to open the configuration dialog. In the section verbs you can "
"select verbs and in the section tenses the tenses you want to practice."
msgstr ""
"Vaš prvi korak korištenja programa treba biti odabir glagola i glagolskih "
"vremena. Koristite  <guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"button_config_kl.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>Config dugme</phrase> </textobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> konfiguracijsko dugme da otvorite "
"konfiguracijski dijalog. U odjeljku glagola možete odabrati glagole i u "
"odjeljku glagolskih vremena birate vremena koja želite da vježbate."

