#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &kverbos; trainer windows"
msgstr "&kverbos; prozori trenera"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Depending on the selected exercise you will see different windows. There is "
"a window where you can enter an infinitive of a verb and the program will "
"show you how to conjugate the verb. Another type of exercise selects tense "
"and infinitive and you enter the forms. Or you select a gap exercise. The "
"last type of exercises does not come with the program. You have to install "
"additional files to get them."
msgstr ""
"U zavisnosti od odabrane vježbe vidjet ćete različite prozore. Postoji "
"prozor gdje možete unositi infinitiv glagola i program će pokazati kako da "
"konjugirate taj glagol. Drugi tip vježbe odabire glagolsko vrijeme i "
"infinitiv a Vi unosite oblike. Ili odaberete vježbu sa prazninama. Zadnji "
"tip vježbe ne dolazi sa programom. Morate instalirati dodatne dadoteke da je "
"preuzmete."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "The VerbViewTrainer - Look up verb forms"
msgstr "TrenerPrikazaGlagola-Traži oblike glagola"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Have a look at the <emphasis>\"VerbViewTrainer-\"</emphasis> window. Here "
"you can look up how to conjugate the verb that you have entered in the input "
"line. Every infinitive you enter is counted as an exercise. If it exists in "
"the programs database it is counted as a correct solution too."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte <emphasis>\"TreneriPrikazaGlagola-\"</emphasis> prozor. Ovdje "
"možete potražiti način kako konjugirati glagol koji ste unijeli u liniju za "
"unos. Svaki infinitiv koji ste unijeli se računa kao vježba. Ako postoji u "
"programskoj bazi podataka ono se također računa i kao tačno rješenje."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "The VerbViewTrainer Window"
msgstr "Prozor TrenerPrikazaGlagola"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot VerbViewTrainer"
msgstr "Snimka zaslona TrenerPrikazaGlagola"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "The FormsTrainer"
msgstr "TrenerOblika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have to be more active in the <emphasis>\"FormsTrainer-\"</emphasis> "
"window. &kverbos; selects a verb and a tense. You have to enter the forms "
"into the lineedit fields. After that you can use the <guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"button_next_kl.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Config button</phrase> "
"</textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> Next-button to correct your "
"input. If some of your entered forms are not correct the color is changed to "
"red. You have a second chance to find the solution. If you have no idea you "
"can go to the solution with the <guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"button_next_kl.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>Config button</phrase> </textobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> Next-button. With this button you can cycle "
"through the whole process: enter forms, correct the input, show the "
"solution, go to the next verb."
msgstr ""
"Morate biti više aktivni u <emphasis>\"TrenerOblika-\"</emphasis> prozoru. "
"&kverbos; odabire glagol i glagolsko vrijeme. Morate da unesete forme u "
"linijskouređivačko polje. Nakon toga možete koristiti<guiicon> "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"button_next_kl.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Konfiguracijsko dugme</"
"phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> dugme Sljedeći da "
"ispravite Vaš unos.Ako neke od vaših unesenih formi su netačne boja se "
"mijenja u crvenu.Imate drugu šansu da pronađete rješenje. Ako nemate ideja "
"možete potražiti rješenja u  <guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"button_next_kl.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>Konfiguracijsko dugme</phrase> </textobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject> </guiicon>dugme Sljedeći. Sa ovim dugmetom možete kružiti "
"kroz cijeli proces :unos formi, ispravak unosa, prikaz rješenja, prelazak na "
"naredni glagol."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid "The FormsTrainer Window"
msgstr "Prozor VježbaOblika"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot FormsTrainer"
msgstr "Snimka zaslona TrenerOblika"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid "The GapTrainer"
msgstr "TrenerPraznina"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another type of trainer window is the <emphasis>\"GapTrainer-\"</emphasis>. "
"You can practice verb conjugation in sentences. Read the task, enter the "
"forms into the gaps and use the <guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"button_next_kl.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>Config button</phrase> </textobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> Next-button to go through the correction cycle."
msgstr ""
"Drugi tip trenerskog prozora je <emphasis>\"VježbaPraznina-\"</emphasis>.  "
"Možete vježbati konjugaciju glagola u rečenicama. Pročitajte zadatak, "
"unesite formu u prazninu i koristite <guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> "
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"button_next_kl.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </"
"imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Konfiguracijsko dugme</phrase> </"
"textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> dugme Sljedeći da bi prošli kroz "
"ispravku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will not see this kind of trainer in a &kverbos; standard installation. "
"To use this trainer you need additional exercise files. Have a look at the "
"&kverbos; webpage to find such files. If exercise files are installed the "
"program extends the menu with this exercises. For further information read "
"the chapter for <link linkend=\"developers\">developers</link>."
msgstr ""
"Nećete vidjeti ovaj tip trenera u &kverbos; -ovoj standardnoj instalaciji. "
"Da bi koristili ovog trenera trebat ćete dodatne datoteke sa vježbama. "
"Pogledajte na &kverbos; web stranici da bi pronašli ovakve vrste datoteka. "
"Ako su datoteke sa vježbama instalirane program proširuje izbornik sa ovim "
"vježbama. Za daljnje informacije pročitajte poglavlje za <link linkend="
"\"programeri\">programere</link>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "The GapTrainer Window"
msgstr "Prozor TrenerPraznina"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot GapTrainer"
msgstr "Snimka zaslona TrenerPraznina"

