#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure Dialog: General"
msgstr "Konfiguracija dijaloga: Osnovno"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "The General Configuration Window"
msgstr "Prozor osnovna konfiguracija"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot General Configuration"
msgstr "Snimka zaslona Osnovna Konfiguracija"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show buttons for the Spanish characters ñ, á, é, í, ó, ú"
msgstr "Prikaži dugmad za španske karaktere ñ, á, é, í, ó, ú"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:317
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Depending on the setup of your keyboard it might not be possible to enter "
"the above mentioned characters. This option helps you. If it is selected, a "
"line of button with the characters is shown below the trainer window. You "
"can insert ñ, á, é, í, ó, ú with these buttons."
msgstr ""
"U zavisnosti od postavke Vaše tastature možda neće biti moguće unositi iznad "
"navedene karaktere. Ova opcija Vam pomaže. Ako je odabrana, linija dugmeta "
"sa slovima će biti prikazana ispod trenerskog prozora. Možete unositi ñ, á, "
"é, í, ó, ú sa ovim dugmadima."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use a verb selection instead the entire verb stock"
msgstr "Koristite izbor glagola umjesto cijelu dionicu glagola"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As &kverbos; comes with over 9 000 verbs and you might not know all of them "
"you can select verbs and practice this selection. With this option you "
"decide if your selection is used or all the verbs."
msgstr ""
"Kako &kverbos; dolazi sa preko 9 000 glagola i možda ne znate sve od njih, "
"možete odabrati glagole i vježbati njihovu selekciju. Sa ovom opcijom možete "
"odlučiti da li je korištena Vaša selekcija ili svi glagoli."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select verbs automatically if they aren't in the selection"
msgstr "Odaberite glagole automatski ako oni nisu u selekciji"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sometimes there are verbs in an exercise that you still did not select. This "
"may happen in the VerbViewTrainer or the GapTrainer. If you have selected "
"this option the program adds new verbs to your selection."
msgstr ""
"Ponekad postoje glagoli u vježbi koje još niste odabrali. Ovo se može "
"dogoditi u TreneruPrikazaGlagola ili u TreneruPraznina. Ako ste odabrali ovu "
"opciju program dodaje nove glagole u Vašu selekciju."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ignore accent while checking the user input"
msgstr "Ignoriranje akcenta prilikom provjeravanja korisničkog unosa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Although it is clear that accents belong to correct spelling the user can "
"check this option and the accents will be ignored during the correction "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Iako je tačno da akcent pripada tačnom spelovanju, korisnik može odabrati "
"opciju i akcenti će biti ignorisani prilikom procesa ispravke."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid "The use of the clock"
msgstr "Korištenje sata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the left side of the trainer window there is a clock. It can be used in "
"two ways. It simply counts the time that you are learning until all "
"exercises are done or you finish your learning process or it works as a "
"counter. That means you select a time and the clock counts backwards until "
"this time has expired. So you can learn a fixed time."
msgstr ""
"Na lijevoj strani trenerskog prozora postoji sat. On može biti korišten na "
"dva načina. On jednostavno odbrojava vrijeme Vašeg učenja dok sve vježbe "
"nisu gotove ili Vi završite Vaše učenje ili radi kao štoperica. To znači da "
"odaberete vrijeme i sat odbrojava unazad sve dok vrijeme ne istekne. Tako da "
"možete učiti tačno određeno vrijeme."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure Dialog: Tenses"
msgstr "Konfiguracijski dijalog: Glagolska vremena"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Tenses Configuration Window"
msgstr "Prozor Konfiguracija  vremena"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot Tenses Configuration"
msgstr "Snimka zaslona Konfiguracija vremena"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select Tenses"
msgstr "Odaberite glagolsko vrijeme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All the tenses you can learn are listed here. Select the ones you want to "
"practice. This selection affects the FormsTrainer. It only uses tenses that "
"you have selected."
msgstr ""
"Sva glagolska vremena koja možete naučiti su izlistani ovdje. Odaberite one "
"koje želite da vježbate. Ovaj odabir utiče na TreneraOblika. On jedino "
"koristi vremena koja ste odabrali."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:362
#, no-c-format
msgid "Proportion"
msgstr "Razmjer"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:363
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We talk of normal tense in this part if the tense is formed only by one "
"word. Composed tenses have a form of haber or estar as the first part "
"followed by the particip or a gerund. Because haber and estar are always "
"conjugated the same way the composed tenses are considered easier and they "
"should not ask as often as the normal tenses. You can set the proportion "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Pričamo o jednostavnom vremenu u ovom dijelu ako je glagolsko vrijeme "
"sadržano od samo jedne riječi. Složena glagolska vremena imaju formu glagola "
"haber ili estar kao prvi dio popraćen participom ili gerundom. Zbog toga što "
"su glagoli haber i estar uvijek konjugirani na isti način, složena vremena "
"se smatraju lakšim i ona ne trebaju biti tražena kao jednostavna vremena. "
"Možete postaviti razmjeru ovdje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure Dialog: Verbs"
msgstr "Konfiguracijski dijalog : Glagoli"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Verbs Configuration Window"
msgstr "Prozor Konfiguracije glagola"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:376 index.docbook:455
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot Verbs Configuration"
msgstr "Snimka zaslona Konfiguracija glagola"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can see a tab-widget with three tabs that helps you to select and "
"deselect the verbs you want to train."
msgstr ""
"Možete vidjeti kartične grafičke kontrolere sa tri kartice koje Vam pomažu "
"da odaberete i poništite glagol koji želite vježbati."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:388
#, no-c-format
msgid "First Tab: List of selected Verbs"
msgstr "Prva kartica: Lista odabranih glagola"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All selected verbs are listed here. These verbs will be used for training. "
"If this list is empty you cannot start studying and the program will give "
"you a hint to select verbs."
msgstr ""
"Svi odabrani glagoli su izlistani ovdje. Ovi glagoli će biti korišteni za "
"vježbanje. Ako je ova lista prazna nećete moći početi učiti i program će Vam "
"dati savjet da odaberete glagole."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:394
#, no-c-format
msgid "Second Tab: Verbs in Grammatical groups"
msgstr "Druga kartica: Glagoli u gramatičkim grupama"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:395
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The known verbs grouped by different conjugation patterns. This helps you to "
"select verbs of a special type, &eg; irregular verbs or changing verbs where "
"'e' becomes 'ie' like 'querer' (group verbs e --> ie)."
msgstr ""
"Poznati glagoli grupisani po različitim konjugacijskim šablonima. Ovo Vam "
"pomaže da odaberete glagole određene vrste, &eg;  nepravilni glagoli ili "
"promjenljivi glagoli gdje 'e' postaje 'ie' kao što je 'querer' (grupni "
"glagoli e-->ie)."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid "Third Tab: Verbs in Alphabetical Groups"
msgstr "Treća kartica: Glagoli u alfabetskim grupama"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:400
#, no-c-format
msgid "As the name of the tabs says the verbs or sorted alphabetical."
msgstr "Kako kaže ime kartice, glagoli ili alfabetski sortirano."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:406
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We mustn't forget the input line below the tab widget. Here you can enter a "
"word or a part of word and the programs looks for infinitives that match "
"your input."
msgstr ""
"Ne smijemo zaboraviti unos linije ispod kartičnog grafičkog kontrolera. "
"Ovdje možete unijeti riječ ili dio riječi i programi će tražiti infinitive "
"koji se poklapaju sa vašim unosom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:409
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You cannot add new verbs to the list or delete one from the list. You cannot "
"edit the verbdata, too. If you encounter mistakes in the verb data, write an "
"e-mail to the author."
msgstr ""
"Ne možete dodati nove glagole na listu ili brisati neki sa liste. Ne možete "
"uređivati glagolsku bazu podataka također. Ako naiđete na pogreške u "
"glagolskog bazi podataka, napišite mail autoru."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:416
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure Dialog: KVTML-Files"
msgstr "Konfiguracijski dijalog: KVTML-datoteke"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:418
#, no-c-format
msgid "The KVTML-Files Configuration Window"
msgstr "KVTML-Prozor Konfiguracija datoteka"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:421
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot KVTML-Files Configuration"
msgstr "Snimak zaslona KVTML-Konfiguracija datoteka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:425
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The verb database doesn't contain any translations of the Spanish "
"infinitives. If you like to work with translations into other languages you "
"can use your favorite KVTML-files containing the translations. You can add "
"several files here. The program reads the files and searches for verbs and "
"their translations."
msgstr ""
"Glagolska baza podataka ne sadrži svaki prevod španskih infinitiva. Ako "
"želite da radite sa prevodima na druge jezike možete koristiti omiljeni "
"KVTML-datoteke koje sadrže prevode. Možete dodati nekoliko datoteka ovdje. "
"Program čita datoteke i traži glagole i njihove prevode."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:434
#, no-c-format
msgid "List of KVTML-files to load"
msgstr "Lista KVTML-datoteka za učitavanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A list of files that you have already selected. You can add and delete files "
"here. These files are used to search for translations."
msgstr ""
"Lista datoteka koje ste već odabrali. Možete dodavati i brisati datoteke "
"ovdje. Ove datoteke su korištene za traženje prevoda."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translated Verbs"
msgstr "Prevedeni glagoli"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:442
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adjust how the translated words are used in &kverbos;."
msgstr "Podesiti kako su prevedene riječi korištene u &kverbos;-u."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:450
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure Dialog: Jigsaw"
msgstr "Konfiguracija dijaloga: Slikovna slagalica"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:452
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Jigsaw Configuration Window"
msgstr "Prozor Konfiguracije slikovne slagalice"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can decide if you want to make use of the jigsaw view. Its purpose is to "
"give some motivation. Select images that are used as pictures for the "
"jigsaw. You can also define how many pieces should be made."
msgstr ""
"Možete odlučiti da li želite koristiti prikaz slikovne slagalice. Njega "
"svrha je da da neku motivaciju. Odaberite slike koje su korištene kao slike "
"za slikovnu slagalicu. Možete također definisati od koliko dijelova treba "
"biti napravljena."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:467
#, no-c-format
msgid "Developer's Guide to &kverbos;"
msgstr "Programerski vodič za  &kverbos;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:476
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kverbos; can be extended with gap exercises. This chapter informs you how "
"to create exercises and how to install them."
msgstr ""
"&kverbos; može biti proširen sa vježbama praznina. Ovo poglavlje Vas "
"informiše kako napraviti vježbe i kako ih instalirati."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:482
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install exercise files"
msgstr "Instaliraj datoteke vježbe"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:483
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The exercise files can be installed for the whole system or for the user "
"only."
msgstr ""
"Datoteke vježbe mogu biti instalirane za cijeli sistem ili samo za jednog "
"korisnika."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:487
#, no-c-format
msgid "Installation for the whole system"
msgstr "Instalacija za cijeli sistem"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:488
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to install exercises so that they are available for every user "
"you have to put the files into the '$KDEDIR/share/kde4/apps/kverbos/"
"exercises/' folder"
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da instalirate vježbe tako da su dostupne za svakog korisnika "
"morate prvo staviti datoteke u '$KDEDIR/share/kde4/apps/kverbos/exercises/' "
"mapu"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:491
#, no-c-format
msgid "Installation for a user"
msgstr "Instalacija za korisnika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:492
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you install the exercise files into the folder '$HOME/.kde4/share/apps/"
"kverbos/exercises/' only this user can see and use them. This way users can "
"add additional exercises by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Ako instalirate datoteke vježbe u mapu '$HOME/.kde4/share/apps/kverbos/"
"exercises/',  jedino ovaj korisnik ih može vidjeti i koristiti. Na ovaj "
"način korisnici mogu dodavati dodatne vježbe sami."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:499
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create additional exercises"
msgstr "Napravi dodatne vježbe"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:500
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every exercise consists of at least three files: 'exercisename.html', "
"'exercisename.menu.en', 'exercisename.solution'."
msgstr ""
"Svaka vježba sadrži barem tri datoteke:  'imevjezbe.html', 'imevjezbe."
"izbornik.en', 'imevjezbe.rjesenje'."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:504
#, no-c-format
msgid "The 'exercisename.html' file"
msgstr "'imevjezbe.html' datoteka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:505
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the exercise itself as it will be presented to the &kverbos; user in "
"the program."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je vježba onakva kakva će biti predstavljena &kverbos;  korisniku u "
"programu."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:508
#, no-c-format
msgid "The 'exercisename.menu.en' file"
msgstr "'imevjezbe.izbornik.en' datoteka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:509
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The file contains information used to extend the menu in the program. The "
"menu will be extended, so that the user can select the exercise."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka sadrzi informacije korištene za nadogradnju izbornika u programu. "
"Izbornik će biti nadograđen, tako da korisnik može odabrati vježbu."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:512
#, no-c-format
msgid "The 'exercisename.solution' file"
msgstr "'imevjezbe.rjesenje' datoteka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:513
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This file contains the solution. It is used by the program to evaluate the "
"user input."
msgstr ""
"Ova datoteka sadrži rješenje. Ona je korištena od strane programa da ocijeni "
"korisnikov unos."

